<p class="entry-meta">Published on: <time class="entry-time">04/24/2025</time></p></header><div class="entry-content"><p>After ten years on the Wrestling staff, four years as Assistant Coach and six as Head Coach, John Chillem will step down from the role of Head Coach at the [&hellip;]</p>
</div><footer class="entry-footer"><p class="entry-meta"><span class="entry-categories">Filed Under: <a href="https://www.camdencc.edu/category/ccc-news/athletics-news/" rel="category tag">Athletics News</a>, <a href="https://www.camdencc.edu/category/ccc-news/" rel="category tag">CCC News</a></span> <span class="entry-tags">Tagged With: <a href="https://www.camdencc.edu/tag/ccc-news-athletics/" rel="tag">CCC News Athletics</a></span></p></footer></article><img src="https://www.camdencc.edu/wp-content/themes/dynamik-gen/images/content-filler.png" class="dynamik-content-filler-img" alt=""></main></div></div><div>
